    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1564090/extras/6aec613dbc0c8172605fc4aa1ce69cf3.avif?t=1622992046\" /></div><br><br>A short game about feeling as if you are behind all your peers.<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Travel through the forest to collect rent from 5 quirky woodland residents<br></li><li>Explore a detailed, hand-drawn lil world by pointing, clicking &amp; pulling<br></li><li>Solve simple logic &amp; physics-based puzzles as you experience a delicate story that takes about an hour to complete</li></ul><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1564090/extras/83d2e1789d9f0ea17f3f21fd26f762c2.poster.avif?t=1622992046\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1564090/extras/83d2e1789d9f0ea17f3f21fd26f762c2.webm?t=1622992046\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1564090/extras/83d2e1789d9f0ea17f3f21fd26f762c2.mp4?t=1622992046\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1564090/extras/a07c06e43844654a325a6ff5ffe617e8.poster.avif?t=1622992046\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1564090/extras/a07c06e43844654a325a6ff5ffe617e8.webm?t=1622992046\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1564090/extras/a07c06e43844654a325a6ff5ffe617e8.mp4?t=1622992046\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><br>hi, my name is Madison Karrh &amp; i made this game.<br>i appreciate that you would spend a piece of your limited time on this planet playing somet